      en: ["First tea seeds were planted as early as 1910.", "Official commercial production began in 2010.", "Located in the Trongsa district of central Bhutan.", "The plantation covers an area of about 43 acres.", "Specializes in high-quality organic green tea.", "Managed and harvested by a local women's cooperative."],
